</table></div><p class="mut" style="margin:6px 0 0">档位=滚动收缩胜率分档（窗口 20260401~20261020，全体基准执1 49.1%/+0.61%，收缩 K=10）；⚠=样本 n&lt;25 小样本。8 笔中只有 002242 一笔同时满足「涨停＋源1净买为正」，也只有它全部质量门槛不达标。</p></div></div><div class="card"><span id="claim-lhb-8899bbc011a1216e"></span></div><div class="" id="claim-lhb-88871afed26b09cb"><div class="claim-head"><span class="claim-role role-evidence">证据</span><span class="claim-source">旧版原文补充</span></div><div class="card"><b>龙虎榜买侧温度</b><div class="kpi"><div class="top"><span class="ico">♨</span><span class="chip2 c-cool">偏冷</span></div><span class="lab">市场温度</span><span class="big">31.0</span><div class="gauge"><div class="gtrack"><i class="gmark" style="left:31.0%"></i></div><div class="gl"><span>冰点</span><span>偏冷</span><span>中性</span><span>偏热</span><span>过热</span></div></div><span class="sub2">272 日窗口 <b>21.0% 分位</b>（57 日更低）；前值 25.5（偏冷）、前前值 14.0（冰点），单日 +5.5 点三连修复，但仍在中性档 45 以下</span></div></div></div><div class="" id="claim-lhb-886ec3f3be379a64"><div class="claim-head"><span class="claim-role role-evidence">证据</span><span class="claim-source">旧版原文补充</span></div><div class="card"><b>钱在哪：席位类型分布（_学习/_资金温度.json，20261021）</b><div id="table-452e216c9f34340e"><table><tr><th>类型</th><th>今日席次/金额</th><th>20261020</th><th>变化</th></tr>
